The embedded ../../opencode_tools.json contains model-facing definitions only,
not executable tool implementations. Definitions originate from OpenCode's
packages/core/src/tool/plugin/ and packages/core/src/codemode/ sources.
The compatibility snapshot was obtained from:
https://github.com/jasonxu114514/opencode2api/blob/a6601da673c03832bf78ce04b100dee8c8a92385/internal/gateway/opencode_tools.json

The snapshot preserves the official client's descriptions and JSON schemas,
including its Windows/PowerShell shell description, dynamic subagent description,
and 2026 web-search description. Preserve these strings when updating the data;
Zen free-tier compatibility depends on complete official definitions.
The gateway request adaptation is implemented independently.
